  "title": "Maple Twists",
  "description": "These sweetened, cream-cheese-filled little pastries are made easier with the use of baking mix. Just pop them in the oven on a bed of brown sugar, maple syrup and nuts, and watch them disappear.",
  "authors": [
    "JJOHN32"
  ],
